//! task: fix
//! ask: Bind the value 300 to a variable.
//! expect: EXS-E0308
//! refs: §8.4
//! explain: A literal takes its type from where it lands, and 300 does not fit a `u8` (0 to 255), so it is `EXS-E0308`. Widen the type. There are no literal suffixes, so the type is chosen on the binding, not on the number.

publica functio f() -> u8 {
    firma x: u8 = 300;
    redde 0;
}
//@ fixed
publica functio f() -> u8 {
    firma x: u16 = 300;
    redde 0;
}
